    {
      "modelVersion": "gemini-2.5-flash",
      "content": {
        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "Aquí tienes la consulta SQL para BigQuery que cuenta la cantidad de pacientes por cada edad al inicio de la observación, estratificado según el género del paciente:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    p.gender_concept_id,\n    g.concept_name AS gender,\n    (EXTRACT(YEAR FROM op.observation_period_start_date) - p.year_of_birth) AS age_at_observation_start,\n    COUNT(DISTINCT p.person_id) AS number_of_patients\nFROM\n    person AS p\nJOIN\n    observation_period AS op\n    ON p.person_id = op.person_id\nJOIN\n    concept AS g\n    ON p.gender_concept_id = g.concept_id\nGROUP BY\n    p.gender_concept_id,\n    g.concept_name,\n    age_at_observation_start\nORDER BY\n    gender,\n    age_at_observation_start;\n```",
            "thoughtSignature": "CnEBjz1rX-vRc2dSfubH5K2uK70oWi-rRnkVd84bcnf2VWGRNGrY8cS9Lbngf8KouXpf4rQGvW3Sr5KleAcalKLSgu6C06KgDo4cgMSqK0SBmt-Cx-GDkN5J2R6Kip9B1sNSGQ0A1TRrCCqwtnlojiXibQ=="
